OL,3,GNEWSAMan escapes injury in petrol bomb
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has escaped injury after a petrol
OL,7,Fbomb was thrown inside a house in
OL,8,FCounty Armagh.
OL,10,FPolice received a report of the
OL,11,Fincident in the Anne Street area of
OL,12,FMilford at approximately 22:25 BST on
OL,13,FWednesday.
OL,15,FA window was smashed and the petrol
OL,16,Fbomb was thrown inside by an unknown
OL,17,Findividual.
OL,19,FPolice are treating the incident as
OL,20,Fdeliberate ignition, with one line of
OL,21,Fenquiry that two unknown males were
OL,22,Finvolved in the attack.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
